In nethack, demogorgon makes you ill or sick.  It's a sickness attack.
In the code, it's an AD_DISE (disease) attack.  On your status line,
it's an "Ill"ness.  Poison resistance has no effect on it.  

It's not poison.  Poison in nethack is something completely different.  

All we're saying is that the death message should agree with the other
messages regarding illness.  However, it's also a trivial problem.  Once
you see the message, you're already dead.  It can wait until everything
